# Paths (globs relative to the scanned root, or bare file names) that may keep the old names (tools/build/check_names.py).
# Only two reasons are valid: a legal notice, or a document about the removal itself. Nothing the runtime loads.
LICENSE
LICENSE.*
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES*
docs/mkw-removal.md
# The former names, as a historical reference (tools/run/envs.py --markdown).
docs/environment-variables.md
# Documents of the removal itself, and the sources page: third-party projects named with their own names and links.
docs/romfs-res-audit.md
docs/research.md
# The first game's performance reports, kept as history with links to where they were filed.
docs/performance.md
# The 0.2.0 release notes name the former variable prefix, to tell players what to migrate.
CHANGELOG.md
# The scanner itself names what it looks for.
tools/build/check_names.py
tools/build/check_names.allow
